data: {"id": "0d26fc19fead4b17-thinking-parallel_evidence-2983", "run_id": "0d26fc19fead4b17", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n   - `namespace=aiops-case-v06, pod=workload, uid=f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8, node=node2`\n   - Phase=Pending, 容器状态 `Waiting / ContainerCreating`, restarts=0\n   - Prometheus 指标确认：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason=ContainerCreating)`, `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`\n\n2. **Pod Spec 关键配置**\n   - Image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` (imagePullPolicy=IfNotPresent)\n   - **无 imagePullSecrets**\n   - Volume: `hostPa", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789127749503, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

