data: {"id": "0d26fc19fead4b17-final", "run_id": "0d26fc19fead4b17", "seq": 2988, "ts_ms": 1789127771464, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v06/workload 卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段，处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` | 状态 `Pending`, 阶段 `Pending`, 容器 `app` 等待原因 `ContainerCreating` | 确认当前症状：Pod 卡在启动前的挂载准备阶段，未进入运行状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: \"MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \\\"input\\\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory\" | **直接证据**：明确指出主机路径存在类型检查失败，这是导致挂载失败的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: \"timed out waiting for the condition\" (x16 over 17m) | 佐证事件：挂载操作在长达 17 分钟内持续失败，排除了偶发性网络或短暂资源争用 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Pod Spec | Volume `input` 类型 `hostPath`, 配置路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` | 提供故障上下文，确认可疑配置对象 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=`ContainerCreating`, value=`1`) | 量化确认等待状态，与 K8s State 中的 `ContainerCreating` 状态一致 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` (phase=`Pending`, value=`1`) | 量化确认调度状态，排除 Pod 被调度到节点后启动失败（Running->CrashLoopBackOff）的可能性 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (value=`0`) | 排除容器反复启动失败的干扰，确认问题发生在容器启动之前 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- 证据 1、4、5、6 共同构建了一个闭环状态：Pod 被调度（Phase Pending），配置了 hostPath（Config），但由于无法完成挂载（State/Waiting Reason），导致容器无法启动。\n- 证据 2 是决定性证据，其指出的 `hostPath type check failed` 完美解释了证据 1 中 `ContainerCreating` 的停滞原因，以及证据 3 中长时间的 `timed out` 现象。\n- 日志与 Tracing 维度（Logging/Tracing）因 Pod 物理上未能启动且 IP 为空，未采集到相关数据，不影响基于 K8s 控制面与节点日志的诊断结论。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nNode 'node2' 上的 hostPath '/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input' 不存在或类型非目录 → \nKubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败，触发 hostPath type check failed 警告 → \nPod volume 挂载超时，触发 FailedMount 事件，Pod 保持在 Pending 状态 → \n容器维持在 ContainerCreating 等待状态，用户无法访问应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod Spec 中配置的 hostPath volume 'input' 路径挂载失败。**\n\n具体而言，Kubelet 在节点 `node2` 上尝试挂载主机路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 时，检测发现该路径**不存在**或者**其文件类型不是目录**（`is not a directory`）。这一底层文件系统状态的不匹配导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 操作持续报错（证据 2），进而导致 Pod 无法完成卷挂载和容器初始化，表现为长期处于 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 1、5、6）。\n\n**关键证据引用：**\n- 证据 2 提供了最直接的故障机制描述。\n- 证据 1 和 5 描述了该机制导致的结果状态。\n- 证据 4 指明了具体的故障配置项。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 42.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 38.6s (Evidence 29.7s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 94.431, "metrics": {"run_id": "0d26fc19fead4b17", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 94.43708872795105, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.16, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 80%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 94437.08872795105, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 91405.1673412323, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7240.291118621826, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2722.841501235962}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 42827.396631240845, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 38594.03872489929, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12982.42473602295, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

